      "message": "The recipe installs Xcode 13? \n\nhttps://logs.chromium.org/logs/pdfium/buildbucket/cr-buildbucket/8709602746533715841/+/u/install_xcode/l_execution_details#L3396_1\n\nThe Xcode version is determined by the runtime OS version.\nhttps://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium.git/+/refs/heads/infra/config/main.star#35\n\nIt needs either\n1) Update the bot dimensions for newer macOS, or\n2) Specify the Xcode version explicitly (if PDFium still needs to build on the old mac bots)\ne.g.\nhttps://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/134050",
