      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T01:21:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for checking. I looked as well. Both luci.flex.ci and luci.flex.try has ~2X as many macOS 12 machines than macOS 14 machines. We can try updating the dimension to macOS 14 and limp along for a bit until ChOps can provision more macOS 14 machines.",
      "parentUuid": "15f43cdb_a5f13f97",
      "revId": "55f199c44c9da983d36ba445471e4efbd3e7eeff",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
